From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 03:31:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Spike: move each stage's state into the System

A recorded step copied its inputs into a local start state, and copied every
stage's state into the System: a statement per entry each time. The start
state is now the recorded inputs, and stages 2 to 6 are moved in, since the
next stage rebuilds them. Bit-identical.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LFsPxk1yy62LrcCbtZUVeB
